### cp -r is not reported by shellcheck 0.11.0
cp -r templates/ /srv/site/
>>> none
>>+ SC2336 1:4 -- shellcheck 0.11.0 predates this check; POSIX leaves cp -r implementation-defined, so -R is the portable spelling

### cp -vr cluster is not reported by shellcheck 0.11.0
cp -vr assets build/
>>> none
>>+ SC2336 1:4 -- shellcheck 0.11.0 predates this check; POSIX leaves cp -r implementation-defined, so -R is the portable spelling

### cp with uppercase -R
cp -R templates/ /srv/site/
>>> none
